  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e3cf711bd06ef4f479a2906fc1414ca9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Vieja6_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptableObjects.Dialogues.DialoguesData
  language: 1
  dialogues:
  - I see you bested the ghost of one of the warriors. <sketchy>You have great potential...</sketchy>
  - Ahem.
  - You will come across many of them. Decades ago, this place was home to a warrior
    tribe. The men battled, the women took care of the men.
  - When the enemies became more difficult to deal with, the tribe needed something
    else to keep the advantage on the field.
  - That is when the women of the tribe started to investigate about ancient stories
    and inhuman powers.
  - None of them saw the dangers of playing with something that <sketchy>big</sketchy>...
